{
 "_doc": "Design tokens for 디지털 생존노트 (one source of truth for video/src/*.tsx and tests/test_design_tokens.py, which checks every text/background pair below against WCAG 2.2 contrast). Layers: core colours -> semantic tones (위험/주의/안전) and topic categories -> note card, caption, type scale (fixed brand layer) -> stages (the per-episode background, grouped into families). Never use red for anything but danger; the category colour is the only other accent on screen.",
