  },
  "_doc": "Captions are identical on every stage: white words with a 12px black outline, the spoken word in yellow. On cream paper the outline is what separates the words from the page; the white-box alternative was measured too (tests/test_design_tokens.py) and has the lower minimum contrast, so the outline stays."
 },
